    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d621">

                <pb facs="1001" n="983" sameAs="frus:frus1948v03/pg983"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">865.30/8–348: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Byington</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-08-03T12:00:00+02:00">August 3,
                            1948—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3267. Subject: Submarine and battleship scrapping.</p>
                <p>Letters, copies of which are being forwarded by mail,<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d621-f1"/> from Sforza dated 28 July state destruction required by
                    “minimum destruction <pb facs="1002" n="984" xml:id="pg984"/> lists” for 31 subs
                    under article 58 paragraph one (C), and 4 subs renounced by US and UK had been
                    effected by 15 April and 15 June respectively and that “minimum destruction” on
                    battleships <hi rendition="#italic">Vittorio Veneto</hi> and <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Italia</hi> has been accomplished. Complete demolition
                    continues on all.</p>
                <p>London for Admiral Conolly. Please pass Navy.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 3267; repeated Paris 508.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byington</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d621-f1" n="1" xml:id="d621-f1-content">
                <p>Despatch 1183 of August 3, 1948, not printed, forwarded translations of these
                    letters to the Department (865.30/8–348).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
